-- Scholarship Rewrite Pass 118 — Norway (2026-10-28) — REPLAY of executed statements
-- Rewrites: 346 University of Oslo Doctoral Research Fellowships (rel 4 -> 10)
--           424 University of Bergen PhD Research Fellowships   (rel 4 -> 10)
-- Aligned with the record-425 (NTNU Doctoral Research Fellowships, rel 10) treatment:
-- Norwegian PhD = salaried advertised employment, NOT a scholarship competition.
-- Evidence fetched first-hand: UiB "Pursuing your PhD at UiB" (uib.no/en/phd, upd. 25.09.2026);
-- UiO uio.no/english/research/phd/ + /before-applying/ (stored URL vacancies/phd/ = 404).
-- Sources: 3119 (UiO Before applying), 3120 (UiB PhD page); root-domain links 2650/2648
-- replaced (source rows retained for audit). university_scholarships: 511 synced, 709 created.
